    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>DnB Starfighter: High-Octane Shoot 'em up</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DnB Starfighter</strong> delivers a relentless shoot 'em up experience where skill reign supreme. Set against the pulsating backdrop of heavy drum and bass tracks by Ruzer, this high-paced shmup challenges you to push your limits and claim your spot on the global leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate increasingly chaotic patterns of enemy fire while the music intensifies around you. When the bass drops, brace yourself as devastating comets hurtle toward your ship, testing your reflexes and evasion skills to their breaking point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path to glory: battle solo to perfect your run, team up with a friend in local co-op to tackle the onslaught together, or face off in split-screen PvP to determine the ultimate starfighter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless survival gameplay that rewards technical mastery and quick reflexes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leaderboards to compete against the world's best pilots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom ship loadouts to match your playstyle and strategic preferences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op and PvP modes for same-screen or remote play action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original drum and bass soundtrack by Ruzer that drives the game's intensity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music-reactive hazards that sync with the soundtrack's most explosive moments</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DnB Starfighter fuses the technical precision of classic shmups with the raw energy of drum and bass. How long can you survive when the tempo hits 174 BPM?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>DnB Starfighter: High-Octane Shoot 'em up</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DnB Starfighter</strong> delivers a relentless shoot 'em up experience where skill reign supreme. Set against the pulsating backdrop of heavy drum and bass tracks by Ruzer, this high-paced shmup challenges you to push your limits and claim your spot on the global leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate increasingly chaotic patterns of enemy fire while the music intensifies around you. When the bass drops, brace yourself as devastating comets hurtle toward your ship, testing your reflexes and evasion skills to their breaking point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path to glory: battle solo to perfect your run, team up with a friend in local co-op to tackle the onslaught together, or face off in split-screen PvP to determine the ultimate starfighter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless survival gameplay that rewards technical mastery and quick reflexes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leaderboards to compete against the world's best pilots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom ship loadouts to match your playstyle and strategic preferences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op and PvP modes for same-screen or remote play action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original drum and bass soundtrack by Ruzer that drives the game's intensity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music-reactive hazards that sync with the soundtrack's most explosive moments</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DnB Starfighter fuses the technical precision of classic shmups with the raw energy of drum and bass. How long can you survive when the tempo hits 174 BPM?</p>",
    "short_description": "High-speed shmup where survival meets rhythm. Evade waves of enemies to pounding drum and bass soundtrack. Compete globally or battle friends in co-op/PvP. Customize your ship, perfect your run, and claim your spot on the leaderboards.",
